; =====================================================================
;  resistors.inc  --  standard resistor value tables (E24, +/-5%).
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------
;  Included inside the .DATA segment of LOWPASSF.asm, right after
;  data.inc.  Contains only data declarations.
;
;  Layout (must stay exactly as below):
;    * R_dec0 .. R_dec6 are seven contiguous REAL4 arrays, 24 values
;      each, one per decade (x1, x10, x100, x1k, x10k, x100k, x1M).
;      Together they are 168 values = 672 bytes, indexed by FINDRC /
;      DESIGNPRINT with a byte offset SI in 0..668 (step 4).  Do NOT
;      insert anything between these arrays.
;    * rdigit0 .. rdigit6 are the matching 6-byte display strings
;      ("ddd.d" + SI prefix), 24 strings per decade, laid out
;      contiguously so DESIGNPRINT can reach string k via
;      rdigit0 + (k/4)*6.  Do NOT insert anything between them.
;
;  The float values are written as decimal REAL4 literals; every one
;  assembles to the same IEEE-754 bytes the original program used
;  (verified entry-by-entry).  Values in decades x10..x1M are exact
;  integers (all < 2^24); the x1 decade uses the standard rounded
;  single-precision encodings (e.g. 1.1 -> 3F8CCCCDh).
; =====================================================================

